- Question (not fixed): Docker Hub's tag API returned 403 (page 11) for golang/node/postgres in the local dry run, so image version updates (golang 1.27 minor, node 26 major, postgres) have no timestamps and stay pending under timestamp-required. Pre-existing and out of this PR's scope (version updates deliberately keep timestamp-required); whether CI sees the same 403 is unverified.
